{'symbol': 'WEC', 'date': '2022-08-29 12:00:00', 'title': "WEC ENERGY GROUP'S CLIMATE REPORT AND CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT HIGHLIGHT SUSTAINABLE PROGRESS", 'text': "MILWAUKEE , AUG. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEC ENERGY GROUP (NYSE: WEC) TODAY RELEASED ITS 2021 CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT AND CLIMATE REPORT. THE CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT PROVIDES A COMPREHENSIVE OVERVIEW OF THE COMPANY'S ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) PERFORMANCE, WHILE THE CLIMATE REPORT FURTHER DESCRIBES THE COMPANY'S GOVERNANCE, STRATEGY AND RISK MANAGEMENT RELATED TO CLIMATE CHANGE."}